me": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1021011425999827", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_1021011429333160_4176289926510597494_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HzsaEm_q5cAQ7kNvwEL_6Wk&_nc_oc=Adm8KYg2TzNyRifOQdhnHIFZ4SYLF4ksqctmBOlujQ2Z_wwkvgfdGacq7mmeZPLxmhU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aftlksis15CkfmdgRIyuCyLp1LekBgeo4BxfW3bcOXmpJA&oe=69984461"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 4.png", "id": "524012790104112", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001669_524012793437445_4891316513078544414_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wT5nxTJyOJ8Q7kNvwFf9-TS&_nc_oc=AdksUo1k7Ko8NMJ07JsCeYsF7vqByablKSPXQhAgLlPttOMYeuwVYtXaOn3qG8dF9GI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsJoetNr_JhLesO786QoM2vsHeFp1VPU61hk_GPLHzi9Q&oe=699858DA"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "1187574142495669", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031470_1187574145829002_8495108821353233334_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zPsPQdOy2kgQ7kNvwHZ473D&_nc_oc=Adk4VAcGg0_AqCV8l-befrKQvohL2h53v0uoYRDdrTJDPuPJ8_I7w_LRWiu7M1Z3aMk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afsc7tOP-R8Kc-yBm5mpyKAdURLeXRah0MYZQJOAwLyxsQ&oe=69984B70"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "529809686395654", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476759_529809689728987_2021663405477506286_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z3qoe0jwhtwQ7kNvwE8vLRV&_nc_oc=Adnene888QEvN_Cyow7ZDuoFo8f3L5ZMwNWtZSBjYUN-_l_1iy4yGGp5qBGS7IsM6Kw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu_X5LdScRwGZIhjUnNmdszRVKxaummg0svF68QAx5mDA&oe=69983D7F"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that allows you to explore cell structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape Mini.png", "id": "2930927027073306", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974477_2930927030406639_1033799740283778117_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IMXOQrHEqAkQ7kNvwF12ysV&_nc_oc=AdkwNb9NKYoVOzgbZbW3IFksucwrGIkASt6_vJpd_XnzHWQh