3070153890993_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Dq9_wB1UNA0Q7kNvwGn4Ehq&_nc_oc=Adk8je2ooOVnJH3k_aiklJ8XWD8IeN_8n3FyDzbde8OS3LPMYQJsA0Ix6emb-JYxZCI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftTR7gM05p2DEHxTmq9zA8inP_7vAQ-R3fqUacuXDzviA&oe=69986BF7"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1543351499921825", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974887_1543351503255158_348442130487521407_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lUTvwhb5buIQ7kNvwE9rG46&_nc_oc=AdnxuVhri1QlyvkB7cqD1pkMW4hs064Lv9cAFCCSRgWB7L3smWyEq4e08g9PMLXcZ0M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvzx33VLri6U8XBuUXAwOpLYT3-d-0HjYuqIRHI3bCjNQ&oe=69987206"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "912383657378781", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031432_912383660712114_2572436446715478623_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Llz-9rkvDDAQ7kNvwEssJ1H&_nc_oc=Adnl7uVY7O0SHBXh5z3vTp725S5T1XVCh96EmyFTEXdp1RNlrE0FiyD3XrEsfyzGf2M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftO4pc3wnC68hMb0w9oSDDH6AaXDx4E3KCrf_Hw7PfBMQ&oe=699858FA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "3748813912049179", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_3748813915382512_2166423531006939259_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F5yo64MxpBkQ7kNvwFchy1P&_nc_oc=AdmwkP8zugPKpKNxjc4wt-Lt0y75Bzk-hzeGE05LKXZm4nZf1ltzp7VyHVmiiWqWpyQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuYWGggxnbM-hgXHugTXl_u32x1N2r14Q1G1Gwy7XLHnw&oe=69986D8D"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that lets you explore cellular structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}]}, "developer_name": "Just Ware", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.iubenda.com/privacy-policy/93783224", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.iubenda.com/terms-and-conditions/93783224", "publisher_name": "Just Ware", "support_website_url": "https://justware.it/supporto/", "website_url": "https://justware.it/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_top